**Play the game:** https://bristol-extends-forgotten-dispatch.trycloudflare.com

Self-contained \`index.html\` (vanilla HTML/CSS/JS + Canvas, no build step). Pilot a glowing thread: collect energy sparks (+10), avoid expanding pulse rings, walls, and your own trail. Start screen, WASD/arrows + touch steering, score + persisted best, pause (P), game-over with death reason, restart (button / R / Space / tap), DPR-crisp responsive neon visuals, inline favicon.

### Final screenshots (captured against the public URL)
